title: $:/language/hypergsd/Settings/

# Priorities additions to the shared Settings string namespace.
Priorities/Caption: Priorities
Priorities/Default/Heading: Default priority
Priorities/Default/Label: Default priority for new items:
Priorities/Default/None: -- none --
Priorities/Default/Hint: A new item will inherit its parent project's priority first. If there is no parent project, or if there is a parent project but it does not have a priority, then the new item will inherit this default.
Fragments/Priority/Caption: Priority select
Fragments/Priority/Hint: A priority select on action and project rows
Priorities/Config/Heading: Priority level configuration
Priorities/Config/PriorityHeading: Priority
Priorities/Config/FillHeading: Fill
Priorities/Config/InkHeading: Text and icons
Priorities/Config/LineHeading: Line (print layout only)
Priorities/Config/NameHeading: Name
Priorities/Config/ShortHeading: Short name
